this Agreement, unless the software is sold or charged to third parties as a
product. Commercial licenses are granted only by separate written agreement.

4. Third-party components

Third-party libraries remain under their own licenses.

5. No warranty

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. TO THE MAXIMUM
EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY
